  // --- gain
  // Bring every mic to a common speaking level, so the mix does not jump when
  // the floor passes between people whose recorders were set differently. Any
  // upward gain is bounded by that mic's own remaining headroom.
  //
  //   'target' — each mic's own dialogue is brought to targetLufs, an ABSOLUTE
